<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Slaven-Potpourri, Op. 39 (Johann Strauss the Younger)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1847</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Domov můj, overture to Josef Kajetán Tyl (Antonín Dvořák)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1882</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Two poems in Larenopfer (Rainer Maria Rilke)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1895</span><span class="sg-chain-h">tribute in poems</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">National anthem of Czechoslovakia, with Nad Tatrou sa blýska</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1918</span><span class="sg-chain-h">first stanza as its Czech part</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Orchestration for large orchestra (Otakar Jeremiáš)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1930</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Official recordings by the National Theatre Opera Chorus and Orchestra (Jiří Bělohlávek)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2008</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording</span></li></ul></section>
